==Old Norse==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|non|gem-pro|*hlaupaną}}, whence also {{cog|ang|hlēapan}} ( > {{cog|en|leap}}), {{cog|ofs|hlapa}} ( > {{cog|fy|ljeppe}}), {{cog|osx|hlōpan}} ( > {{cog|nds|lopen}}), {{cog|nl|lopen}}, {{cog|goh|hlaufan}} ( > {{cog|de|laufen}}). Ultimately from {{der|non|ine-pro|*klewb-||to spring, stumble}}.

===Verb===
{{non-verb|hljóp|hljópu|hlaupinn}}

# to [[leap]], [[jump]], [[spring]]

